# Style gallery

One live sample of every Keydown chip and mark family, drawn by the real engine, in a different color down the page. Write the tag in the middle column, with your own words where it says `text`. Every family comes in sixteen colors, and the [full reference](#/keydown-reference) lists them all!

::tip Colors
The letters inside the tag pick the color, like R for red, B for blue and PK for pink. Swap them to recolor any sample!
::end

## Families 1 to 40

| Family | Write | You get |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Bubble | `#R#text#` | #R#Sample# |
| Gloss pills | `%O%text%` | %O%Sample% |
| Gel flags | `#%GL%text%` | #%GL%Sample% |
| Gel tabs | `#^Y^text^` | #^Y^Sample^ |
| Gel drops | `#+L+text+` | #+L+Sample+ |
| Gel splits | `#:G:text:` | #:G:Sample: |
| Gel lenses | `#;TU;text;` | #;TU;Sample; |
| Jelly | `#/T/text/` | #/T/Sample/ |
| Jelly Bean | `#/C=text=` | #/C=Sample= |
| Gummy | `#/B~text~` | #/B~Sample~ |
| Layered Jelly | `#/PR+text+` | #/PR+Sample+ |
| Jelly Cube | `#/PK^text^` | #/PK^Sample^ |
| Fruit Jelly | `#/R%text%` | #/R%Sample% |
| Jelly Drop | `#/O!text!` | #/O!Sample! |
| Swirl Jelly | `#/GL?text?` | #/GL?Sample? |
| Jelly Tart | `#/Y#text#` | #/Y#Sample# |
