| Glitter Jelly | `#/G.text.` | #/G.Sample. |
| Star Jelly | `#/TU*text*` | #/TU*Sample* |
| Jelly Egg | `#/T@text@` | #/T@Sample@ |
| Jelly Worm | `#/C&text&` | #/C&Sample& |
| Citrus Jelly | `#/B$text$` | #/B$Sample$ |
| Heart Jelly | `#/PR<text<` | #/PR<Sample< |
| Jelly Capsule | `#/PK>text>` | #/PK>Sample> |
| Molded Jelly | `#/R[text[` | #/R[Sample[ |
| Jelly Splat | `#/O]text]` | #/O]Sample] |
| Ice Jelly | `#/GL}text}` | #/GL}Sample} |
